<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech fund RIF 1996 gross CZK 2.97 bln.</title>
<headline>Czech fund RIF 1996 gross CZK 2.97 bln.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Czech investment fund Restitucni a Investicni Fond a.s. (RIF) said on Thursday it posted a 2.97 billion crown preliminary gross profit in 1996, compared with a 4.95 billion loss in 1995.</p>
</text>
